  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "gHIwijYtklUotAr2twqJ-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720.4350537832848,
      "y": -1155.235800399925,
      "width": 1436.1835090416962,
      "height": 135.01137906223408,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1994195025,
      "version": 590,
      "versionNonce": 403273055,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794572568934,
      "created": 1794562846444,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "design a bookmarks manager. People find links online — articles, docs, videos —\nand want to save them and find them again later, from any device. Let’s start\nwith requirements. What would you like to clarify?",
      "fontSize": 36.00303441659575,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "design a bookmarks manager. People find links online — articles, docs, videos — and want to save them and find them again later, from any device. Let’s start with requirements. What would you like to clarify?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PFKrrI6x6P2HC9cebgP4-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 721.1604789272274,
      "y": -991.6308997846339,
      "width": 1361.5578986106746,
      "height": 1260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 971872127,
      "version": 1412,
      "versionNonce": 1207989329,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794572565644,
      "created": 1794563104722,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\nUsers should be able to:\n- Create folders: one level\n- Save a URL: with a name in a folder\n- View the bookmarks in a folder\n- Search bookmarks (by name)\n- Edit or delete a bookmark\n\nNon-Functional requirements:\nThe system should be:\n- Fast: save bookmarks and search for them in about 500ms\n- Highly available (fault tolerance) when failure happens\n- Secure (users data and user A should not read userB bookmarks or data)\n- Durable: data is not lost\n- Scalable when traffic spikes happens (seasons, events) --> 10 million\nregistred users, 1 million of them active on a given day (spikes: 3 times the\nnormal level)\n\nCore entities: User, Folder, Bookmark\n\n    API endpoints:\n    - POST /folders (folder data in body)\n    - POST /bookmarks (bookmark data in body)\n    - GET folders/:folderId/bookmarks(sorting, pagination etc...)\n    - GET /bookmarks?name=name\n    - PUT /bookmarks/:bookmarId (New data in body)\n    - DELETE /bookmarks/:bookmarkId\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\nUsers should be able to:\n- Create folders: one level\n- Save a URL: with a name in a folder\n- View the bookmarks in a folder\n- Search bookmarks (by name)\n- Edit or delete a bookmark\n\nNon-Functional requirements:\nThe system should be:\n- Fast: save bookmarks and search for them in about 500ms\n- Highly available (fault tolerance) when failure happens\n- Secure (users data and user A should not read userB bookmarks or data)\n- Durable: data is not lost\n- Scalable when traffic spikes happens (seasons, events) --> 10 million registred users, 1 million of them active on a given day (spikes: 3 times the normal level)\n\nCore entities: User, Folder, Bookmark\n\n    API endpoints:\n    - POST /folders (folder data in body)\n    - POST /bookmarks (bookmark data in body)\n    - GET folders/:folderId/bookmarks(sorting, pagination etc...)\n    - GET /bookmarks?name=name\n    - PUT /bookmarks/:bookmarId (New data in body)\n    - DELETE /bookmarks/:bookmarkId\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
